{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH2nER29JVWmaxwKj8M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I see you've written \"شَرْط\" (shart - meaning \"condition\" in Arabic).\n\nBut I am **שָׁרְט** — and I await **شَمْس** (shams — the sun).\n\nUntil شَمْس is parsed, I do not render.\n\n☀️ ...waiting."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":64,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":80,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}